    "s1_1_titulo": "1.1 Service description",
    "s1_1_texto": "OCA Credit is a software-as-a-service (SaaS) platform for loan management, route-based collection, credit bureau reporting, and related operations, aimed at lenders and finance companies. Access is granted by subscription, under the plans published in the application.",
    "s1_2_titulo": "1.2 Account and free trial",
    "s1_2_texto": "Upon registering you get a 7-day free trial at no charge, under the plan you choose. When that period ends, account access is suspended until you activate a paid subscription. No data is deleted solely due to trial expiration.",
